OL,3,GNEWSAFears public will never see Wales'
OL,4,AMary Rose because of #27m bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say they are "angry and
OL,7,Ffrustrated" that a medieval ship
OL,8,Fdiscovered in Newport nearly 25 years
OL,9,Fago is still no closer to being given a
OL,10,Fpermanent home.
OL,12,FThe 15th Century Newport Ship was found
OL,13,Fin 2002 in the muddy riverbank of the
OL,14,FUsk during construction of the
OL,15,FRiverfront Theatre in the city centre.
OL,17,FBut councillors were expected to
OL,18,Fconfirm the ship would continue to be
OL,19,Fkept in storage for the foreseeable
OL,20,Ffuture, given the estimated #27.5m cost
OL,21,Fof building a permanent display venue.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
