OL,3,GNEWSAFears public will never see Wales'
OL,4,AMary Rose because of #27m bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother factor was the "very limited
OL,7,Favailability" of a suitable site in
OL,8,FNewport, although the council said its
OL,9,Flong-term ambition was "to enhance
OL,10,Fpublic interpretation of the ship".
